## Scenarios

### JS native fetch credentials

#### defaults an option-less fetch to same-origin credentials

- Verify: defaults an option-less fetch to same-origin credentials


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: defaults an option-less fetch to same-origin credentials")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
expect(_fetch_request_credentials(
    "window.fetch('/a'); 'ok'"
)).to_equal("same-origin")
```

</details>

#### propagates an explicit include credentials mode to the request

- Verify: propagates an explicit include credentials mode to the request


<details>
<summary>Executable SSpec</summary>

Runnable source: 5 lines folded for reproduction.
Reproduction: this block contains the complete executable scenario source.

```simple
step("Verify: propagates an explicit include credentials mode to the request")
# @req: REQ-SSPEC-LOCAL-001
expect(_fetch_request_credentials(
    "window.fetch('/a', { credentials: 'include' }); 'ok'"
)).to_equal("include")
```

</details>

